            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-slate-850 pt-3">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block mb-1">Recommended Physical Hardware:</span>
            <span id="vramHwVal" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-purple-950/60 text-purple-300 border border-purple-800/80 block text-center">
